  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kyrgyzstan: Assistance to the Government of the Kyrgyz Republic in Joining the United Nations Convention on International Settlement Agreements Resulting from Mediation (the &#x2018;Singapore Convention on Mediation&#x2019;)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1) To conduct legislative and institutional analysis of the readiness of the Kyrgyz Republic to implement the Singapore Convention on Mediation. 2) To provide legislative drafting assistance to implement the Singapore Convention on Mediation. 3) To develop the capacity of Kyrgyz stakeholders on the implementation of the Singapore Convention on Mediation.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Direct beneficiaries: Ministry of Justice, judges, professional lawyers, mediators, government officials, enforcement officers, businesses and business associations. Indirect beneficiaries: Businesses and investors</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aimed to assist the Government of the Kyrgyz Republic in the process of joining and implementing the Singapore Convention on Mediation.</narrative>
  </description>
